        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4883, Modern Ridged Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA stand-out in minimalist-contemporary design, the Modern Ridges at Edge Refrigerator Pull features subtle detailing that adds depth to the piece while still keeping its fashionable style. The Modern Ridged Appliance Pull is available in two sizes: a 12 inch and an 18 inch center to center. It is available in satin nickel, polished nickel, antique english, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/modern-ridged-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-883\"><b>Modern Ridged Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-ridged-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-784\"><b>Modern Ridged Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PH-4883</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 13-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PH-4883</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 20-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (bolts through the door). Also available matching <a href=\"/products/ridges-at-edge-door-pulls-pair-rk-international-ph-4902bm\">Pair Ridges at Edge Door Pulls Back to Back Mounted</a> door pulls for both sides of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
