                "title": "Modern Ridges at Edge Refrigerator Pull",
                "description": "RK International AP-PH-4883, Modern Ridges at Edge Refrigerator Pull - A stand-out in minimalist-contemporary design, the Modern Ridges at Edge Refrigerator Pull features subtle detailing that adds depth to the piece while still keeping its fashionable style. The Modern Ridged Appliance Pull is available in two sizes: a 12 inch and an 18 inch center to center. It is available in satin nickel, polished nickel, antique english, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.",
